      <p><seg source="#source-444-534">此度、門為参候て海山の咄御国の咄も聞つくし、誠におもしろく奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-534-546">レ</note><seg source="#source-546-609">存候。然、私の心中などのこらず此の為に咄有</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-609-621">レ</note><seg source="#source-621-654">之候間、くは敷御聞取可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-654-666">レ</note><seg source="#source-666-669">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-669-681">レ</note><seg source="#source-681-707">遣と存候。稽首。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-707-781" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p><seg source="#source-728-743">正月廿二日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-743-781" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(2)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=2"><seg source="#source-773-781">龍馬</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-781-859" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p><seg source="#source-802-823">坂本乙様　左右</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-823-859" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(2)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=2"><seg source="#source-853-859">直柔</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
